<title>INDIA: TENNIS-INDIAN OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-INDIAN OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the $430,000 Indian Open men's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Andrei Pavel (Romania) beat 1-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>7-Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Pat Cash (Australia) 6-7 (3-7) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>6-Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat Oliver Delaitre (France) 6-1 3-6 6-0</p>
<p>4-Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Marco Mengeschincheri (Italy) 4-6 7-5 6-0</p>
<p>Rainer Schuttler (Germany) beat Gaston Etlis (Argentina) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Gerard Solves (France) beat 8-Lionel Roux (France) 7-6 (7-4) 6-2</p>
</text>
